+```sh
+cargo build --release
+python3 tests/computer_background.py target/release/lessagent
+```
+
+The test opens an isolated Chrome profile with a local canvas drawing web app,
+restores the previously foreground application after Chrome launches, and sends
+all input through Lessagent's native computer tool. It checks trusted/unfocused
+page events, text editing, continuous star geometry, scrolling, invalid targets,
+and foreground/cursor observations. It saves the actual window screenshot and a
+JSON evidence report under `output/background-control`, then closes its test
+Chrome and server. It does not use CDP, WebDriver, or JavaScript input injection.
